<title>BELGIUM: EU accepts 25,659 T beef into intervention.</title>
<headline>EU accepts 25,659 T beef into intervention.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's beef management committee on Friday accepted bids to sell 25,659 tonnes of beef into intervention, a European Commission official said.</p>
<p>&quot;There are continuing signs that the beef market is picking up but offers were for a total of 42,049 tonnes,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>Price details were not immediately available.</p>
